{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107290","id":2576917528,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZmKQY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107290","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107290.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107290.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107290","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107290/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107290/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107290/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1c9bc22fa6e8f86ca5c5724ae705ed8475bd45b6","number":107290,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Improve NavigationAgent2D debug performance","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Improves NavigationAgent2D debug performance by using static mesh and multimesh.\r\n\r\nThe old debug used the classic canvas draw functions for line segments and rects. Those are really inefficient for longer paths due to each creating either a new internal throwaway mesh or a new draw command.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes the agent path debug to a single static mesh for all the line segments, aka a single draw.\r\nAll the path points reuse a single rect mesh that is rendered with a multimesh.\r\n\r\nShould be a net-gain for all projects but projects with a lot of agents and longer path stability (aka not querying a new path every frame like a madman) will see the biggest performance boost by this change.\r\n\r\nSince line width is not supported by mesh line primitives (and never worked great to begin with on a lot of hardware) the option is deprecated and hidden from the inspector.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","description":"","color":"ff7766","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation",